class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">591d390d-68b7-4937-9103-3772493ab132</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:591d390d-68b7-4937-9103-3772493ab132\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:591d390d-68b7-4937-9103-3772493ab132\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Vellioth\" title=\"Vellioth\">Vellioth's</a> ancient skull in <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador%27s_Dungeon\" title=\"Cazador's Dungeon\">Cazador's Dungeon</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Unfurling the scroll reveals a list of foul rites and rituals, detailing all the ways death can be turned to one's advantage (or simply made more interesting). \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>The Rite of Perfect Slaughter, the Liturgy of the Dead, the Sacrament of the Damned, and many more strange, accursed rituals cover the parchment. The final entry, however, is familiar.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><b>The Rite of Profane Ascension</b>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Oh, piteous dead! Oh, ravenous dead!\n</p><p>Immortality is your gift, but darkness is your prison and hunger its gaoler. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>The Rite of Profane Ascension will release you. Walk in the sun. Suffer not from hunger. Grow your power beyond anything you imagined. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>A pact has been made with the <a href=\"/wiki/Mephistopheles\" title=\"Mephistopheles\">Lord of Hellfire</a>. Deliver unto him seven thousand souls, each bearing an Infernal mark, and you shall be free of your chains. You shall know true power. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Deliver the souls. \n</p><p>Speak the words. \n</p><p><i>Ecce dominus,</i>\n</p><p><i>Has animas offero in sacrificio,</i>\n</p><p><i>Nunc volo potestatem quam pollicitus es mihi.</i>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading the scroll advances the quest <a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\">The Pale Elf</a>.</li>\n<li>The Latin at the end of the text translates to <i>Behold lord, I offer these souls in sacrifice, Now I want the power that you promised me.</i></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200826\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1336/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26890/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9191/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935644/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.098      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.098      1 -total\n 50.77%   19.850      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.24%   17.687     15 Template:Trim\n 24.74%    9.672      2 Template:Uid\n 17.20%    6.725      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.95%    5.456      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.85%    4.242      1 Template:Notes\n 10.12%    3.958      1 Template:Icon_link\n  9.84%    3.848      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12675-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200826 and revision id 365503. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}